/eval/88e364bc.py-8-    Detect legend blocks on the border.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/88e364bc.py-9-\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/88e364bc.py-10-    A legend is a border-touching non-background component whose most common color is the legend\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/88e364bc.py-11-    background `C` (and also the region border color it controls). The legend contains at least\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/88e364bc.py-12-    two additional colors: a \"center\" color (more frequent) and an \"indicator\" color (less frequent).\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/88e364bc.py-13-\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/88e364bc.py-14-    The movement direction for regions with border color `C` is:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/88e364bc.py-15-      sign(centroid(indicator) - centroid(center))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/88e364bc.py:16:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/88e364bc.py-17-    h, w = g.shape\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/88e364bc.py-18-    non_bg = g != bg\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/88e364bc.py-19-    best: dict[int, tuple[int, tuple[int, int]]] = {}\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/88e364bc.py-20-    for pts in components_mask(non_bg, connectivity=4):\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/88e364bc.py-21-        if not any(r == 0 or c == 0 or r == h - 1 or c == w - 1 for r, c in pts):\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/88e364bc.py-22-            continue\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/88e364bc.py-23-        # Legends are filled rectangles on the border.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/88e364bc.py-24-        r0, c0, r1, c1 = bbox_coords(pts)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/88e364bc.py-25-        area = (r1 - r0 + 1) * (c1 - c0 + 1)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/88e364bc.py-26-        if area != len(pts):\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/88e364bc.py-27-            continue\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/88e364bc.py-28-\n/home/